Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuanfeng !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did his cultivation recover entirely in just a few years !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:30.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’ve got guts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,to invade Xue Yue’s Ice and Snow Palace !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of this single word
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,was no weaker than Soul Transformation !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,My two bodies merged together
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,are mutually enhancing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This mutation didn't happen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’ve actually reached Late stage Soul Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will refine your soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't drag others
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,into our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then the both of us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,will settle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,what happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone, retreat 10 000 li !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(231,400)\fad(300,300)}Soul Extracting Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll make sure you don't make it out alive today !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This drum can disturb the Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you enjoy the taste of my Soul Extracting Drum ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can the drum fail ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slash !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the power of Soul Transformation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you have humiliated me like this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,if not for my unhealed injuries !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if my cultivation plummets today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will still kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tea Domain !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you taste the strength of celestial spiritual energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The physical form of a Soul Transformation cultivator’s domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,is really strong !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xue Yue becomes your grave !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Transformation spells are profound
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,but your celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far too sparse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hoped this fight would help me grasp what Soul Transformation is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you’ve indeed given me new insights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If celestial spiritual energy can infuse a domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,can Ancient God power do the same ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What domain is this ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and Death
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reincarnation !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,His domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,has already reached Soul Transformation ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you are the one who sent that man back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unseal !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're unworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,of these artifacts !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I die today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will drag you down with me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suzerain !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suzerain !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suzerain !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exploding your Origin Soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can tear open a spatial rift and leave anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the only ones who will die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the people of Xue Yue...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Xue Yue is innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,don’t slaughter them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man will be at your mercy !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want your Soul Transformation soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suzerain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,has fallen to Nascent Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,no Soul Formation cultivators are allowed to exist in Xue Yue
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and cultivation sects are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you disobey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:17.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:25.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, Xue Yue climbed over the Four Sects Alliance’s corpses
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become a rank 5 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:28.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,the tide has turned...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected, this old man has a keen eye for talent !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid actually killed a Soul Transformation cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a Late stage Soul Formation cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.63,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1511,468)\fad(300,300)}Zhou Wutai\NMiddle stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not an easy feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang is truly extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,He turned Xue Yue to a rank 3 country
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you should help him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will go fight Liu Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,See how far her Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,has progressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhuque Zi’s disciples can’t be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Especially Qian Feng,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's the most gifted cultivator I’ve ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zi Xin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,was once his cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,she may become a crack in his Dao Heart someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for Liu Mei’s domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Wutai’s Emotion Severing Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,might stand a chance against it !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei seems drawn to Wang Lin’s domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,might be the key to breaking Zhuque Zi’s game !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,our wager back then
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,stipulated 1 000 years of seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 12 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then we’ll see who will inherit the title of Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who knows what will happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu’s attack on Xue Yue
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,ended with him singlehandedly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,slaying its Suzerain,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,sealing all the cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and demoting the country to rank 3 !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mighty Li Yuanfeng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,has been
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,defeated !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuanfeng was just a trash forcibly raised to Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you can kill the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you’ll barely qualify
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,as my opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used Soul Search on Li Yuanfeng
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,but found no clues about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You said that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to wake you at Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That must be because I need celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuanfeng's cultivation was forcibly raised
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he lacked celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a genuine cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,With his teleportation spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,even Sun Tai feared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I can fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,That day, the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor insisted on taking my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have my own reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,He must have learned
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,about the Heaven Defying Bead from his clansmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once he recovers from his injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,he’ll surely come back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do I fight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,or do I flee ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,the outcome is uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if I flee,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will miss my best chance to kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Ouyang Tian,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was sent by Ancestor Du Tian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to deliver something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Du Tian knows your plans
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,so he instructed me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot leave seclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I can offer you this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,details how to counter the Giant Demon Clan's teleportation spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's how...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this other item
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something you’ve seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Billion-Soul Flag ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is just an illusory sub flag
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,that can only be used twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sub flag has a third of the true flag's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 12 golden soul fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,are past Sect Leaders who reached Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,With them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,this flag’s power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,To control this Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must cast
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Soul Sealing spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a powerful pressure !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ve given you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will wait for you at the Soul Refining Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Giant Demon Clan Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't escape this !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:42.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:54.11,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:54.11,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:20:01.71,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:20:01.71,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:09.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:09.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:12.59,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.59,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:16.31,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.31,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:20.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.39,0:20:23.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:27.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:31.87,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:31.87,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:36.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:36.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:39.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:47.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:50.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:55.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:21:01.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:05.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.19,0:21:09.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:09.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:12.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:17.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:21.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:25.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:29.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:32.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:36.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:39.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:45.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
